Z||000006||Kevin-84SE||12-04-2000||09:00 AM||||I had a leak in my AC system when my car was new, every year I had to take it in for a recharge, the dealer claimed that they could not find any leak. Then one time when I had the car up on jack stands I found the leak, The connector in the AC line (I think it was a little behind the fuel tank and was secured to the bottom of the car) was loose and when I moved the AC line a little, I could hear the coolant leak out. I tightened the connector and it has never leaked since and my AC still works fine.<P>   Kevin||||reg||1
